    "creative": "The semi gantry ad brought 354 messages at $37.78 MXN each. It opens 'One side of your plant has structure. The other does not.' and invites a WhatsApp chat; its carousel version added 155 at $48.82. The stacker ad opens 'Your team loses time every time a heavy load must move' and brought 73 at $61.55. The two hoist ads open on general efficiency and cost $72.55 and $101.52. We recommend testing a hoist ad that opens on a plant problem, since problem-first openings keep winning.",
